('T001','Same-request queued async transactions preserve invocation order and distinct return values.',['Call first transaction and queue KV put.','Call second transaction before first callback acquires its local hold.','Record both admissions; hold first callback for one finite timer.','Release; second reads first commit and replaces value.'],'Same incoming call; two live transaction promises; one 20ms local hold.','Exact first-start,first-end,second-start order; returns 11,22; final value second.'),
('T002','A rejected async transaction releases its queue slot without resetting the recipient or poisoning its queued successor.',['Admit failing first and healthy second before hold.','First queues a dirty KV value and pauses.','First throws planned-first; catch only that error.','Second observes absent failed key and commits its independent marker.'],'Same-request queued failure/healthy overlap.','Expected rejection; exact first,second entry order; survivor=7 and failed key absent.'),
('T003','Explicit rollback settles its callback return while restoring both KV and SQL before a queued successor enters.',['Admit first and successor transaction calls.','First writes KV and SQL then enters local hold.','Release and explicitly rollback the transaction view.','Successor checks both absence conditions and commits a fresh KV value.'],'Same-request rollback with mixed-storage dirty state and pending successor.','Returns rolled,after; rolled-back KV and SQL absent; successor read proves after=9.'),
('T004','An omitted nested transaction promise is drained before the parent commits and the queued top-level successor enters.',['Admit outer and successor.','Outer starts child without awaiting it; child holds after KV write.','Outer callback returns while child remains pending.','Child releases; parent and successor settle.'],'Three async transaction promises: parent, child, successor.','outer-return,child-end,next order; child and outer keys survive; parent result and successor result exact.'),
('T005','A handled rejection of an omitted child promise rolls back the child without rejecting a successful outer callback.',['Outer writes retained key and starts unawaited child.','Child writes private key and pauses; attach rejection handler.','Outer returns; queued successor remains outside transaction.','Child throws; parent drains child and commits only outer write.'],'Same-request child-failure drain and pending independent successor.','Expected nested-planned rejection; outer resolves; next sees outer=3 and no inner.'),
('T006','Outer failure waits for its already-running child before rolling back both layers and admitting a successor.',['Admit outer and successor.','Outer starts child, child writes and holds.','Outer throws while child is pending.','Child returns; outer rollback completes; successor verifies clean state.'],'Same-request asynchronous outer-error/child-success overlap.','Child result survives as return only; both stored keys absent; successor commits recovered=1.'),
('T007','Explicit outer rollback with a pending child marks its view terminal immediately but waits for child teardown before database rollback.',['Outer starts child and child holds.','Outer calls rollback with child pending.','New put on rolled-back parent view must reject.','Child settles and successor verifies descendants were removed.'],'Pending child, terminal parent API guard, queued successor.','Parent put rejected as rolled back; explicit return preserved; descendant list empty; next=4.'),
('T008','A root storage transactionSync helper nests into the same event async transaction after an await and isolates its caught failure.',['Outer writes KV and pauses; successor already queued.','After release invoke root transactionSync helper that writes KV+SQL then throws.','Catch helper error and invoke healthy root sync helper.','Commit outer and inspect from queued successor.'],'Async parent/root-helper savepoint routing under queued same-request work.','Failed helper KV/SQL absent; helper-good and outer keys survive; successor sees exact list.'),
('T009','Root-handle async reentry after an await composes with an inner sync helper under the correct outer rollback boundary.',['Admit outer and successor; hold outer.','Use root async transaction inside active owner callback.','Inside helper use root synchronous transaction.','Throw outer error and let successor verify all layers rolled back.'],'Async reentrant root plus sync descendant plus pending successor.','Outer error exact; empty KV list after all descendant work; fresh=8 commits.'),
('T010','A put promise admitted through a transaction view cannot flush its discarded value into the queued next transaction.',['First and second transactions admitted.','First pauses, calls put without await, immediately rolls back.','Second first asserts the rolled-back key is absent, then writes and reads its own value.','Await admitted old put only after both transaction results.'],'Same-request admitted-put and closed-scope ordering; no claim that promise remains pending into successor callback.','Successor initially reads undefined; both returns exact and final late=survives; earlier admitted promise completes harmlessly.'),
('T011','A live prepared-query cursor retains its parameters while a separate request executes the identical busy cached SQL.',['Primary reads first row of prepared range 0..3 and holds.','Peer request executes identical query with range 4..7 to exhaustion.','Release primary and consume remainder.','Reuse primary prepared closure with third binding range.'],'Two distinct incoming calls and live same-SQL statement cache occupancy.','Primary prefix/remainder, peer range, and fresh range exact; no duplicated or cross-bound rows.'),
('T012','A paused raw SQL iterator is independent of a peer object-row cursor using the identical cached query.',['Primary starts raw iterator and consumes first tuple.','Hold primary while peer uses object-row iterator with different binds.','Release and drain raw tuples.','Verify cursor and raw iterator share terminal exhaustion.'],'Cross-request raw/object iterator overlap on one storage connection.','Exact raw tuple remainder, peer result, stable column names, final done=true.'),
('T013','Object iteration and raw iteration share one cursor position without peer cached-query reuse rewinding either view.',['Primary consumes one object row and one raw tuple from same cursor.','Hold and run distinct peer query.','Resume original object toArray.','Resume old raw iterator after shared exhaustion.'],'Cross-request interference while two local iterator views share native statement.','Only rows 2 and 3 remain; raw iterator cannot replay consumed rows.'),
('T014','one() cardinality failure does not strand or incorrectly rewind its still-live SQL cursor during a competing cached query.',['Open four-row cursor and call one().','Catch multiple-results error after exactly two rows consumed.','Peer executes identical SQL while original remains live.','Drain original remainder and run singleton recovery query.'],'Cross-request overlap after local cursor API failure.','Exactly rows 2,3 remain; peer exact; singleton query returns n=7.'),
('T015','An exhausted empty cursor cannot acquire rows from a later reuse of its cached statement.',['Prepare and exhaust empty range.','Keep original cursor while peer executes same query with nonempty range.','Resume exhausted original.','Issue new prepared query and verify separate result.'],'Cross-request cache-reuse boundary with terminal original cursor; not two live native readers.','Old cursor stays done and empty; peer and fresh query return their own exact rows.'),
('T016','A legal UNIQUE-constraint failure in a peer request cannot finalize or poison another live read statement.',['Primary consumes read prefix and holds.','Peer attempts duplicate unique label and catches constraint error.','Peer proves failed insert absent.','Resume primary cursor and run count recovery query.'],'Cross-request live cursor versus native statement-step failure.','Primary exact remainder; duplicate absent; eight original rows remain.'),
('T017','Rollback of an unrelated peer write transaction preserves an already-active native reader.',['Primary consumes one numbers row and holds.','Peer transactionSync writes effects then throws planned error.','Peer verifies effects rollback.','Release reader and consume old cursor to exhaustion.'],'Cross-request live reader versus independently caught synchronous transaction failure.','All original reader rows delivered once; no effects persisted.'),
('T018','Prepared closures created from committed and rolled-back transaction views reject new execution while root SQL remains usable.',['Capture one prepare closure from a committed transaction and one from explicit rollback.','Hold incoming request with both local closures.','Peer runs normal root SQL.','Reject execution through both terminal views then query root storage.'],'Cross-request terminal-view boundary; closures stay local to one active invocation.','Committed and rolled-back errors independently matched; healthy root returns n=1.'),
('T019','SQL BLOB values are copied before later binding serialization mutates their shared backing buffer.',['Bind a byte-offset slice followed by object whose toJSON mutates backing bytes.','Open UNION cursor with separate tail BLOB.','Hold while peer uses ordinary SQL.','Drain original typed rows.'],'BLOB acceptance/native-cursor lifetime across independently entered request.','Original slice remains [10,11], tail [1,2], labels exact despite input becoming 99 bytes.'),
('T020','Identical SQL with simultaneously live cursors in two recipients stays storage-scope local.',['Primary opens partial cursor and holds.','Secondary changes only its own labels to secondary-*, opens same cursor and holds concurrently.','Release secondary and fully settle it first.','Release primary and verify both receipts against distinct root identities.'],'Two active requests in distinct Durable Objects; no process/isolate separation claim.','Primary v* and secondary secondary-* ranges exact; recipient identities differ and match their calls; reverse settlement preserved.'),
('T021','Characterize connection-wide rowsWritten accounting when an unrelated request writes during a read-only cursor lifetime.',['Primary opens read-only four-row cursor and holds.','Peer inserts three effect rows and confirms count.','Release primary and drain SELECT.','Record final rowsWritten.'],'Cross-request read cursor/native write overlap; pinned behavior characterization only.','Rows intact and final rowsWritten=3 from frozen connection total_changes delta; never a per-statement accuracy promotion.'),
('T022','A deferred native stepping error is delivered after the last good row, exactly once, despite a peer query in between.',['Open indexed four-row query with malformed JSON only at n=2.','Consume first row; next good row is prefetched.','Hold while peer query completes.','Return row n=1, then throw malformed JSON once, then report done and run recovery.'],'Cross-request live cursor with deferred native step error.','Good prefix 0,1; next throws malformed JSON; following next done; recovery returns n=7.'),
('T023','Bind-count validation failure on identical SQL cannot discard another request live statement when the cache entry is busy.',['Primary opens identical two-parameter query and consumes first row.','Peer invokes SQL with only one parameter.','Peer catches bind-count rejection and runs healthy query.','Release primary and drain exact remaining rows.'],'Cross-request busy-cache prepare/bind failure.','Wrong-binding error exact; peer recovery exact; original cursor remains intact.'),
('T024','Cached prepared metadata is refreshed after a peer request changes the referenced table schema.',['Prime prepared SELECT * cursor and fully exhaust it.','Hold request retaining prepared function.','Peer adds column with default and verifies table row.','Reexecute prepared query and inspect fresh columnNames and row.'],'Cross-request idle prepared-cache/schema invalidation boundary; no active reader DDL assumption.','Column names id,value,added; row includes added=7 and original bound row value.'),
('T025','A pending root put from a rolled-back synchronous callback cannot contaminate the next async transaction boundary.',['Synchronous transaction admits an unawaited root put and throws.','Start successor transaction, assert shared is undefined before pause or overwrite.','Await old put completion while new transaction is pending.','Commit new same-key value and read after both settle.'],'Single-request pending-put/sync-to-async ordering boundary; not independent request contention.','Expected sync-boundary error; successor initially reads undefined; old promise settles; final shared=new.'),
('T026','Failure serializing an ordinary KV batch queues no successful prefix and leaves a held SQL cursor usable.',['Primary opens SQL cursor and holds.','Peer submits Map containing a function between ordinary entries.','Peer requires TypeError with the pinned could-not-be-cloned message, then writes one healthy key.','Release reader and inspect exact KV list.'],'Cross-request native SQL cursor versus KV batch admission failure.','No prefix or suffix keys; healthy=42 only; original SQL rows exact.'),
('T027','A batched transactional KV delete reports real deletion count but restores keys before a queued list on explicit rollback.',['Seed a,b,c; admit delete transaction and successor.','Delete a,b,missing and hold.','Rollback; successor lists all restored keys then deletes b normally.','Read final list.'],'Same-request async transaction queue with destructive operation rollback.','First delete count2; successor list a,b,c; only successor b deletion survives.'),
('T028','Pending batch put, get-many, list and delete preserve their API call order through microtask flushing.',['Seed old key and establish safe pretrace hold.','Release and call put Map, get-many, list, delete without awaits.','Await each result.','Inspect final prefix list.'],'One-request microtask ordering boundary; no cross-request or timer concurrency claim.','Read and list observe complete new batch before delete; delete true; final p:a=new only.'),
('T029','Characterize sync KV single-iterator invalidation without incorrectly invalidating an independent live SQL cursor.',['Primary consumes one sync KV pair then opens SQL cursor.','Hold primary while peer starts and exhausts reverse kv.list.','Resume old iterator and match invalidated-generation error.','Drain unaffected SQL cursor.'],'Cross-request KV iterator generation replacement plus live SQL reader; pinned characterization.','Peer reverse pairs exact; old KV iterator invalidates; SQL delivers all four original rows.'),
('T030','Finite native SQL aggregation completes while an independent recipient request remains held and both recover.',['Primary waits at precompute hold.','Secondary enters its own held health request.','Release primary to run bounded 64x64 recursive CTE aggregation.','Observe actual compute-complete marker and result before releasing secondary.'],'Cross-recipient active-request overlap; 4096 native input pairs; no fairness/interruption guarantee.','sum=4064256,count=4096; primary recovery count8; independently held peer later returns42.'),
('T031','A locally resumed preentered request retains its original event identity and queues outside a different owner transaction.',['B enters and waits on safe external hold; A peer enters before any transaction.','Release B; it establishes local ready and owner-open waits with bounded timers.','A waits local ready before beginning transaction, writes dirty KV and resolves owner-open locally.','B invokes root transaction and signals queued locally; A rolls back.','B callback enters afterward and commits its own key.'],'Two independently identified incoming requests; purely local promise continuations under transaction gate; host-op delivery is not assumed.','Exact owner-open,preentered-attempt,preentered-queued,owner-rollback,preentered-transaction-enter ordering; distinct request IDs; other-owner absent; B value5; missing schedule BLOCKED.'),
